    "commencement": null,
    "amendment_action": null,
    "content": "Every female employee shall be entitled to maternity leave for a period of not less than sixty consecutive days (also referred to in this Chapter as the \u201celigible period\u201d) in respect of each confinement and, subject to this Chapter, she shall be entitled to receive from her employer a maternity allowance to be calculated or prescribed as provided in subsection (2) in respect of the eligible period.",
